 "transcript": [
  "[action] The eldest son returns with his wife.",
  "[action] Wang Lung watches his eldest son return, troubled.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and I have a wife that I take very seriously, and I shall not have her slighted,\"",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son returns with his wife.",
  "[silence] Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "[action] Wang Lung sits and watches, puzzled.",
  "[action] The eldest son watches his father and his second son, curious.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"What is it, father?\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"That woman of yours---how did you meet her?\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Tell me the truth and nothing but the truth.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"What woman?\"",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son explains his wife's background.",
  "the eldest son: \"There is a house where my wife and I live. It is small and I have not been in it for a long time,\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"It is not so small, and it is not a house. It is a room, but it is not a house.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung demands to know the woman's name.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and what is her name?\"",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son explains his wife's name.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"She is a woman who has no name, and she is not a woman, and she has not been a woman since she was a girl.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Now that is strange!\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"She has a name. What is her name?\""
